# The repo is LF throughout, and half of it is edited on Windows. Without this,
# every tool that rewrites a file there stores it with CRLF and the diff is the
# whole file for no change at all -- which happened to seventeen files on
# 17-09-2026 and had to be undone by hand. Git now normalises on commit, so it
# cannot happen again whichever machine the edit was made on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored as they came: a third party's licence file is not ours to reflow.
win_app/assets/** -text
